\f1\b \cf0 \
Action Import, Action Index & Action Link\
\pard\tx1440\tx2880\tx4320\tx5760\tx7200\slleading40\ql\qnatural

\f0\b0 \cf0 \
Three folder action scripts to import, index or link to new files and folders. Use the script "Enable Folder Actions.scpt" to enable folder actions and afterwards the script "Attach Script to Folder.scpt" to attach the action scripts to one or more folders (those scripts are located in the folder "/Library/Scripts)". \
\
The Finder's contextual menu of Mac OS X 10.3 (or later) also provides the commands "Enable Folder Actions", "Attach a Folder Action..." and "Configure Folder Actions..." and therefore you don't need the mentioned scripts.\
\
\ul Note:\ulnone  It's recommended to copy all folder action scripts to the directory "/Library/Scripts/Folder Action Scripts".\
\pard\tx1440\tx2880\tx4320\tx5760\tx7200\slleading40\ql\qnatural

\f1\b \cf0 \
Finder Import\
\pard\tx1440\tx2880\tx4320\tx5760\tx7200\slleading40\ql\qnatural

\f0\b0 \cf0 \
A toolbar script to import the contents of the folder of the active Finder window. \ul Note:\ulnone  This script doesn't  require a specific location.\
\
\pard\tx1440\tx2880\tx4320\tx5760\tx7200\slleading40\ql\qnatural

