\f1\b \cf0 Link to current document\
\pard\tx1440\tx2880\tx4320\tx5760\tx7200\slleading40\ql\qnatural

\f0\b0 \cf0 \
A script to add a link to the current document (e.g. a PowerPoint presentation or an Excel spreadsheet) to the DEVONthink database. To use this script, activate the script menu extra (see "/Utilities/AppleScript/Install Script Menu") and copy the script afterwards to the folder "~/Library/Scripts".\
